        {
          "text": "Lino uwe, O mwana amuntu, utabayoowi, utayoowi majwi aabo, nekuba kuti bakukataazya mbuli mamvwa amitubetube, nekuba kuti ulakala atubanze. Utayoowi majwi aabo nikuba kukankama kumasyu aabo, nkaambo nduzubo lukataazya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
